    WHEN `o 43 r 3(4) it is stated` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `o 43 r 3(4) it is not stated` THEN JUST TRUE

DECLARE `o 43 r 3(4) what the statement of claim gives particulars of` HAS
    `o 43 r 3(4)(1) full particulars of the facts and matters on which the claimant relies in support of the claimant's claim for damages` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 43 r 3(4)(2) details of any conduct by the defendant which it is alleged has increased the loss suffered` IS A `o 43 r 3(4) a statement may be required`
    `o 43 r 3(4)(3) details of any loss which is peculiar to the claimant's own circumstances` IS A `o 43 r 3(4) a statement may be required`

-- FORK QB | bare "must" (the claimant must give full particulars in the statement of claim of the facts and matters on which the claimant relies in support of the claimant's claim for damages): something required is not there | NOTHING | JUST FALSE for the compliance question
